  "question": {
    "text": "For a uniformly charged ring of radius <math><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the electric field on its axis has the largest magnitude at a distance <math><mi>h</mi></math> from its centre. Then value of <math><mi>h</mi></math> is:"
